      "uid": "zhcn:1b32a954619af73452db71fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王放弃参加“菊花赏”。\n同样崇拜着“皇帝”也文摄辉对她感同身受，\n因而陷入沮丧的情绪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e2fdd523a4ae1abe0b606230d378f0ccead299c095be36fe6e042c55f5c544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
