      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，训练员却告诉她，\n有一种只有她才能做到的鼓励方式。然后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f784dfd0cf71ba81d7822b7b5cea046e8894545d53b0c290e112de395e78b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078404.json",
      "json_path": [
