      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也文摄辉向东海帝王诉说自己的心意。\n表达自己曾因她宣示将“超越”崇拜的\n“皇帝”这句话而觉醒。所以──",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f3de8be6378e44406962f964de5b643189b9f016e9646f7b9d972e57ff81af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078404.json",
      "json_path": [
