      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次轮到自己宣示超越“皇帝”了。\n她要称霸中距离战，实现\n“英里皇帝”也没能做到的“称霸三阶级”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a2a4d7d988e10bbe726202920ad53a4b73099e6e652dc4d95f68b4d2612876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078404.json",
      "json_path": [
