    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95dbb383c361cd798cf65f82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王再度骨折。\n诊断结果是来不及赶上\n两人约定好的“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1afef0e6b5108824995a27111d63d29d3af698cee489ca0e69b2a07017d7c570",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
