    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a971633d96c2ed2d33647b7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "更重要的是……今后就算复出，\n因为双脚已经变得脆弱，\n能恢复原本水准的几率很低。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9bffc98d639c916cba561c70c9671295ae1a982620f82a1c303969b048a6082",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
