    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37bcf55aeb9052ea1bcd58e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而东海帝王并没有放弃。\n因为也文摄辉还在朝目标前进，\n所以她也想要继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fbf2dd9e48e3252c3659b123b27552be6e1ae3b0608c3960fb50cba6ef5a77c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
