    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dacd501ef086873cc073adec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然没办法赴约“天皇赏（秋）”，\n但誓言自己一定会复出。\n所以她要也文摄辉再给她一点时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f742e56eac788deab742989df8ddf6744efea9b0355c9c1c8076d00510bd37c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
