    {
      "uid": "zhcn:967870f2808fdf8c542a7eda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训即将开始前。只差一冠就能达成\n不败的三冠称霸的东海帝王骨折了。\n并被告知参加“菊花赏”的机会渺茫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7553dd4ac361764683b73d22e62c2b3b88f8291c014fddf1f404caef3a3b5b15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1078/storytimeline_501078406.json",
      "json_path": [
