    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85267ecf33d78f8b0eda9639",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "痊愈需要六个月──\n但东海帝王已经开始积极复健，\n誓言自己一定要赶上参加“菊花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f841bd4e50ead0f11d026a041890b512b91ca62b6c0b40bdbc77c5672431c29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
